  "description": "In a time not too far in the future, humanity will have achieved its goal of being immortal. But the younger generation conflicts with the older generation to obtain the right to grow up and succeed in their place. The fight rages on, with no clear hope for the young ones. \n\nWho will win? Was war the only answer? \n\nJin, former leader of the South and stricken with amnesia, turns up after being gone. He is challenged at every turn to fight for his survival, all the while having doubts about the extreme situation. \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
